<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on June 20.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on June 20.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 June 20		June 19</p>
<p>Fed acct			 8.606		  7.212</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  36.666		 33.458</p>
<p>Cash balance		  45.273		 40.671</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,245.617	     5,243.943</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $683 million were issued and $18 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
